# MagicSquare TDD Testing Rule

## Test Framework
- Use `pytest`.
- Use AAA pattern in tests (`Arrange`, `Act`, `Assert`).
- Test file names must start with `test_`.

## RED
- Write or update a failing test first.
- Confirm failure for the intended reason.

## GREEN
- Implement minimum code to pass the current test.
- Keep scope limited to the current behavior.

## REFACTOR
- Improve structure without changing behavior.
- Re-run relevant tests after refactor.

## Must Not
- Do not add behavior-changing implementation before RED.
- Do not weaken assertions to force green.
- Do not skip tests to bypass failures.

## Coverage
- Keep overall minimum coverage at 80% or higher.
